# --- Copyrighted material: players supply their own legally owned copies ---
# Play content lives under LetsPlay/. The old root patterns stay so an
# unmigrated checkout does not show local books as untracked files.
LetsPlay/Rules/2014/*
!LetsPlay/Rules/2014/README.md
LetsPlay/Rules/2024/*
!LetsPlay/Rules/2024/README.md
Rules/2014/*
!Rules/2014/README.md
Rules/2024/*
!Rules/2024/README.md
# loose rulebook files directly under Rules/ (only our own rulings are tracked;
# shipped rulings defaults live in LetsPlay/Rules/defaults/ and user copies in
# LetsPlay/Rules/rulings*.md stay local)
LetsPlay/Rules/*.md
LetsPlay/Rules/*.pdf
Rules/*.md
Rules/*.pdf
LetsPlay/Adventures/*
!LetsPlay/Adventures/README.md
Adventures/*
!Adventures/README.md
# Non-SRD monster stat blocks (Monster Manual only)
LetsPlay/Rules/combat/2024/monsters/scarecrow.yaml
Rules/combat/2024/monsters/scarecrow.yaml
LetsPlay/Rules/combat/2014/monsters/allosaurus.yaml
Rules/combat/2014/monsters/allosaurus.yaml
LetsPlay/Rules/combat/2014/monsters/scarecrow.yaml
Rules/combat/2014/monsters/scarecrow.yaml
LetsPlay/Rules/combat/local/
# Local chargen data built from the user's own books (talkdnd data import)
LetsPlay/Rules/chargen/local/
Rules/chargen/local/
Rules/combat/local/
# any PDF, anywhere
*.pdf

# --- Personal play data (saves, session logs, DM secrets) ---
LetsPlay/Saves/*
!LetsPlay/Saves/README.md
Saves/*
!Saves/README.md
**/dm-secrets.md
**/dm-plan.md
**/secret-terms.yaml
**/secret-terms.cache.json
**/identified.yaml
**/rolls.log

# --- Build artifacts / tool state ---
tools/combat-sim/target/
tools/talkdnd-dev/target/
# The play binary is local. Release archives and fetch-binary unpack it here.
# The old tools/bin path stays ignored so a leftover file is not committed.
LetsPlay/bin/combat-sim
LetsPlay/bin/combat-sim.exe
LetsPlay/bin/talkdnd
LetsPlay/bin/talkdnd.exe
tools/bin/combat-sim.exe
target/
.codegraph/
*.state.json
combat-state.json
.opencode/

# Agent-Orchestration single-user machine-local state
.orchestration/
# talkdnd local update state (installed file list, obsolete files, default hashes)
.talkdnd/
LetsPlay/.talkdnd-files.txt
# Worktree root: one execution instance per worktree, at a fixed path
.worktrees/
# Private machine-local files (never committed): .env, host info, release-scan rules
.local/*
!.local/README.md
# Python caches from local helper scripts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- pdf2md: generated Markdown, page images, state, environments (never committed) ---
**/.md/
LetsPlay/.pdf2md/
LetsPlay/tools/pdf2md/.venv/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
